cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use perf_kit or its benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "perf_kit: fast, exact LoRA fine-tuning for hybrid Gated-DeltaNet LLMs on NVIDIA GH200"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Stefan-Lucian"
    family-names: "Deleanu"
    affiliation: "LogoLabs.org"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - LoRA
  - fine-tuning
  - Qwen3.5
  - Gated DeltaNet
  - GH200
  - MFU
abstract: >-
  A LoRA fine-tuning engine for Qwen3.5-style hybrid (Gated DeltaNet + gated attention) and dense decoder LLMs,
  with CPU float64 exactness tests against transformers + PEFT and a reproducible benchmark against transformers +
  PEFT and ms-swift on NVIDIA GH200.
notes: >-
  Developed and benchmarked with compute from the EuroHPC AI Factory allocation EHPC-AIF-2026PG01-907 on
  Arrhenius (NAISS).
